{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"4cc395f5-a62f-4cab-a19f-d265d92f8952","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The Intervals.icu OAuth integration has been fixed, and the root causes have been documented in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n1. **Init Endpoint ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/server.py), [`static/app.js`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/static/app.js))**:\n   - Converted `/api/intervals/auth/init` to an authenticated `POST` endpoint returning `{\"authorize_url\": \"...\"}` as JSON.\n   - Updated the frontend Connect button to trigger an authenticated `fetch` with the user's `Authorization: Bearer` header before redirecting via `window.location.assign(authorize_url)`.\n2. **Scope Configuration ([`config.py`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/config.py))**:\n   - Fixed the scope string to avoid duplicate scopes (`:WRITE` implies `:READ`), setting `SCOPES = \"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`.\n3. **Token Lifecycle \u0026 Expiry Handling ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/server.py))**:\n   - Removed artificial 1-hour expiration and background refresh passes (`Intervals.icu` tokens do not expire or return `refresh_token`).\n   - Implemented lazy revocation handling: clearing stored credentials and marking the account as needing reconnection upon receiving a `401` from the Intervals API.\n4. **Token Exchange \u0026 Security ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-a5M1tL/server.py))**:\n   - Updated `exchange_code` to submit only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n   - Packaged OAuth `state` as a signed HS256 JWT containing `sub`, `purpose: \"intervals_oauth\"`, and a 15-minute expiration timestamp.\n   - Added an athlete ID mismatch guard during reconnection to prevent linking mismatched accounts.\n","duration_seconds":133.238389,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":205217,"output_tokens":7633,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":976441,"total_tokens":212850}}}
